e  steak house is and people I mean she  didn't say a word she didn't have a  microphone I mean you know how noisy it  is in Grand Central but within like five  minutes everybody knew that she was  there and they were literally thousands  of people had stopped down below in the  in the in the hall and they were looking  up at her and they started chanting  Hillary Hillary and it happened to be  her birthday and I guess someone knew  that because someone started singing  happy birthday and I mean utterly  spontaneously 3,000 people singing happy  birthday to Hillary and grand central  might one of the other people in the  press corps said she's not Hillary she's  a Vita so well I think I think I've used  up my hour and I thank you all for  coming and I hope you bought my book on  the first-time author and I I appreciate  your applause and your laughter very  much  thank you very much thank you for the  questions please do come up especially  if you have more questions and pick up a  copy of the book thank you
 

